From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 09:40:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] remoteproc: qcom: complete secure WCSS boot and crash signaling

Consolidate consecutive changes within this functional responsibility.
Retain the final implementation and its error handling directly.

Merged from:
  2010-02-remoteproc-qcom-q6v5-read-crash-reason-from-remote-smem.patch
  2010-03-remoteproc-qcom-wcss-refresh-userpd-bootargs.patch
  2010-04-remoteproc-qcom-q6v5-distinguish-crash-completions.patch
  2010-05-remoteproc-qcom-wcss-sec-load-auxiliary-firmware.patch
  2010-06-dt-bindings-remoteproc-describe-wcss-secure-pil.patch

